    "body": "## [4.44.3](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.44.2...v4.44.3) (2026-11-05)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **deps:** adopt published EventStore SDK 4.1.0 ([#161](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/161)) ([06a51f5](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/06a51f55bfe2e03a06e1121d94a41e98f1e3e251))\n* **deps:** adopt the published EventStore SDK 4.1.0 ([82b4032](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/82b4032afeca8a48b82678ff6673e757df1ff692))\n* **deps:** refresh compatible package releases ([539e6f7](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/539e6f704e3dda9c77ec23c1dfc4c72f539f6f68))\n* **runtime:** bind released reference declarations ([62d2cec](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/62d2cec88c384b9d80cdefc23f3fb330c848cad1))\n* **runtime:** bind released Tenants 7.0.2 provenance ([caa08cd](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/caa08cd60b2d047fad7b89ff065c7a9b95a7cc5a))\n* **runtime:** resolve the direct module catalog ([918eb6b](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/918eb6bce5fade37ba2626aad93ca1a232cc9030))\n* **test:** rebind SDK 4.1.0 contract fixtures ([184f837](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/184f8377b277b0befabcb8350a8ff2fe1aa5ee55))\n"
  },
